flowchart LR
 A[Forecast text] --> V[Input fields and validation]
 L[Location/period/warning if supplied] --> V
 U[Audience/language/word limit] --> V
 V --> P[Select Baseline or Structured template]
 P --> B[Backend prepares filled prompt]
 B --> M[Rule-based mock output]
 M --> O[Advisory draft and heuristic review]
 O --> H[Human verification]
